"Dislikes": ["Piscine Wiverns", "Fishing", "Getting bored", "Being called dummy", "Cruelty", "Poachers", "Unauthorized hunters", "Breaking monster's eggs", "Vespoids", "Damaging her equipment", "Sad people", "Secrets", "Dung pod"];
